						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Send blocked_owner/blocked_repo and blocking_owner/blocking_repo in the
IssueMeta body so Gitea can resolve cross-repository links. Default those
fields to the path issue&#39;s owner/repo.

Add issue_read method check_blocked to summarize open blockers, and
document that dependency endpoints 404 when the repo has issue
dependencies disabled.</pre>
						
						
