						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Gitea resolves the IssueMeta body against owner+repo, not only the
URL. The SDK type only has Index, so block/unblock/add/remove
dependency calls looked up a repo named &#34;&#34;. Send the path owner/repo
in the JSON body via DoJSON.

Assisted-by: Devin:SWE-2 Medium</pre>
						
						
