							<span class="commit-summary " title="refactor: replace mcp-go with the official MCP Go SDK (#223)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/efcbdbb17faaa579a972808838d222b97be06eda" class="muted title-full-link">refactor: replace mcp-go with the official MCP Go SDK (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/223" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#223</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/efcbdbb17faaa579a972808838d222b97be06eda" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
