						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Carries over the applicable rules from <a href="https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea</a> `AGENTS.md`, covering test scope, linter escape hatches and PR conventions. Swaps `Co-Authored-By` for the `Assisted-by` trailer.

Reviewed-on: <a href="https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/224" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/224</a>
