						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Adds a read-only `get_job` method to the `actions_run_read` tool. `actions_run_read` could already `list_jobs` / `list_run_jobs` (slimmed lists) and read job logs by `job_id`, but there was no way to fetch the full detail of one job. `get_job` closes that gap.Reviewed-on: <a href="https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/211" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/211</a>
Reviewed-by: Lunny Xiao &lt;<a href="mailto:xiaolunwen@gmail.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">xiaolunwen@gmail.com</a>&gt;
Co-authored-by: bircni &lt;<a href="mailto:bircni@icloud.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">bircni@icloud.com</a>&gt;</pre>
						
						
