						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Fixes interoperability issues. Without descriptions, several MCP tools throw errors and refuse to parse the responses. Easiest to reproduce in mcp-probe.

