					<td class="message">
						<span class="message-wrapper">
						
							
							<span class="commit-summary " title="Add `org.opencontainers.image.source` label (#193)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/e36137f5a1507a16f60e1414777f6c81c79b03b8" class="muted title-full-link">Add <code class="inline-code-block">org.opencontainers.image.source</code> label (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/193" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#193</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/e36137f5a1507a16f60e1414777f6c81c79b03b8" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
							</span>
						
						</span>
						
						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Two image-label fixes:

- Add `org.opencontainers.image.source` so tools like renovate can retrieve release notes from the source repo.
- Re-declare `ARG VERSION` in the final stage. `ARG` after `FROM` is stage-scoped, so the builder-stage `VERSION` never reached the final stage and `org.opencontainers.image.version` expanded to an empty string in published images.

<span class="issue-keyword">Closes</span> <a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/192" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#192</a>

