							<span class="commit-summary " title="Update golangci-lint and tighten lint config (#190)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/9275c5a0e1f8d5c98955c14194619274b3a9a04a" class="muted title-full-link">Update golangci-lint and tighten lint config (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/190" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#190</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/9275c5a0e1f8d5c98955c14194619274b3a9a04a" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
