						</span>
						
						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Bump `golangci-lint` to v2.12.2 and pin `govulncheck` to v1.3.0. Align `.golangci.yml` with the gitea repo&#39;s config: enable `revive` `var-naming` (with `skip-package-name-checks`) and drop the test-file exclusion for `errcheck`/`staticcheck`/`unparam`. Fix the now-surfaced `errcheck` violations in test handlers by discarding return values to match the existing codebase pattern.

---
