							<span class="commit-summary " title="Add package listing and management tools (#170)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/cd82f6f207d8041b440509d79cef8e1a428fceaf" class="muted title-full-link">Add package listing and management tools (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/170" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#170</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/cd82f6f207d8041b440509d79cef8e1a428fceaf" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
