							<span class="commit-summary " title="Add tool annotations and PR close/reopen support (#174)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/329a97d5d240f0eecd33c42053c91e7c3ad8d86e" class="muted title-full-link">Add tool annotations and PR close/reopen support (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/174" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#174</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/329a97d5d240f0eecd33c42053c91e7c3ad8d86e" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
