					<td class="sha">
						
						
							
						
						<a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/4c45b42cb5487976018f3895f63e0d99d9ff3a53" class="ui label commit-id-short " rel="nofollow">4c45b42cb5</a>
					</td>
					<td class="message">
						<span class="message-wrapper">
						
							
							<span class="commit-summary " title="feat(config): support GITEA_ACCESS_TOKEN_FILE for Docker secrets (#186)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/4c45b42cb5487976018f3895f63e0d99d9ff3a53" class="muted title-full-link">feat(config): support GITEA_ACCESS_TOKEN_FILE for Docker secrets (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/186" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#186</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/4c45b42cb5487976018f3895f63e0d99d9ff3a53" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
							</span>
						
						</span>
						
						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">I don&#39;t like secrets just being added via environment variables. Add support for the `_FILE` environment variable convention used by Docker secrets.

When `GITEA_ACCESS_TOKEN_FILE` is set, the token is read from the file at that path (e.g. `/run/secrets/gitea_token`). Trailing newlines are stripped to handle the typical Docker secrets file format on both Linux and Windows.

Token resolution precedence (highest to lowest):

  1. `--token` / `-T` CLI flag
  2. `GITEA_ACCESS_TOKEN` env var
  3. `GITEA_ACCESS_TOKEN_FILE` env var

Reviewed-on: <a href="https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/186" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/186</a>
Reviewed-by: Lunny Xiao &lt;<a href="mailto:xiaolunwen@gmail.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">xiaolunwen@gmail.com</a>&gt;
Co-authored-by: Dennis Gaida &lt;<a href="mailto:gitea@mail.gaida.biz" data-markdown-generated-content="">gitea@mail.gaida.biz</a>&gt;
Co-committed-by: Dennis Gaida &lt;<a href="mailto:gitea@mail.gaida.biz" data-markdown-generated-content="">gitea@mail.gaida.biz</a>&gt;</pre>
						
						
					</td>
					<td class="tw-text-right"><relative-time prefix="" tense="past" datetime="2026-05-09T23:04:50Z" data-tooltip-content data-tooltip-interactive="true">2026-05-09 23:04:50 +00:00</relative-time></td>
