						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Use `golangci-lint fmt` to format code, replacing the previous gofumpt-based formatter. <a href="https://github.com/daixiang0/gci" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://github.com/daixiang0/gci</a> is used to order the imports.

Mirrors <a href="https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/37194" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/37194</a>.

