								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/9ce5604e4c8c7d5c4b2711f5530c045aaa3ce9ea" class="muted title-full-link">Improve CLI help text and flags (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/139" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#139</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/9ce5604e4c8c7d5c4b2711f5530c045aaa3ce9ea" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
