					<td class="message">
						<span class="message-wrapper">
						
							
							<span class="commit-summary " title="fix: replace goreleaser-action with direct go install">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/653781a19949a19ab62c8b7b22c884ddc138e120" class="muted title-full-link">fix: replace goreleaser-action with direct go install</a></span>
							</span>
						
						</span>
						
						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">The goreleaser/goreleaser-action@v7 JS wrapper was crashing in CI
before goreleaser could run. Install goreleaser via `go install`
instead to avoid the action&#39;s compatibility issues with the runner.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 &lt;<a href="mailto:noreply@anthropic.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">noreply@anthropic.com</a>&gt;</pre>
						
						
					</td>
