								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/67a1e1e7fe231eb19b1331a4beedd64065c2b56e" class="muted title-full-link">feat: accept string values for all numeric input parameters (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/138" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#138</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/67a1e1e7fe231eb19b1331a4beedd64065c2b56e" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
