							<span class="commit-summary " title="fix: add missing required attributes to search tool schemas (#135)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/3b9236695c7a6659d4b3395898b9d91b76c7cb7b" class="muted title-full-link">fix: add missing required attributes to search tool schemas (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/135" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#135</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/3b9236695c7a6659d4b3395898b9d91b76c7cb7b" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
