						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">## Summary
- Add `mcp.Required()` to `keyword` in `search_repos` and `search_users` tool schemas
- Add `mcp.Required()` to `org` and `query` in `search_org_teams` tool schema
- Add test verifying required fields are set on all search tool schemas
- Fixes MCP clients failing with `keyword is required` because the schema didn&#39;t declare the field as required

<span class="issue-keyword">Closes</span> <a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/115" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#115</a>

