							<span class="commit-summary " title="chore: add golangci-lint, bump Go to 1.26, fix all lint issues (#133)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/8728c04748e701a383fa488cf9340691b62ee165" class="muted title-full-link">chore: add golangci-lint, bump Go to 1.26, fix all lint issues (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/133" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#133</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/8728c04748e701a383fa488cf9340691b62ee165" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
