							<span class="commit-summary " title="feat: add edit_pull_request tool (#125)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/21e4e1b42bd694356b381bd0211ee391df0b8112" class="muted title-full-link">feat: add edit_pull_request tool (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/125" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#125</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/21e4e1b42bd694356b381bd0211ee391df0b8112" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
