						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">## Summary
- Add `edit_pull_request` MCP tool to modify pull request properties
- Supports editing title, body, base branch, assignees, milestone, state, and maintainer edit permission
- Enables toggling WIP/draft status by modifying the title prefix

Fixes <a href="https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/issues/124" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/issues/124</a>

## Test plan
- [x] `go test ./...` passes
- [x] Verified against gitea.com: toggled WIP on/off via title edit, changed PR state

<span class="emoji" data-alias="robot">🤖</span> Generated with [Claude Code](<a href="https://claude.ai/claude-code" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://claude.ai/claude-code</a>)

