							<span class="commit-summary " title="feat: add Gitea Actions support (secrets, variables, workflows, runs, jobs, logs) (#110)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/17119bcab6709f0e381305d331e05933863719a3" class="muted title-full-link">feat: add Gitea Actions support (secrets, variables, workflows, runs, jobs, logs) (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/110" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#110</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/17119bcab6709f0e381305d331e05933863719a3" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
