								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/8b06d7154e59e8056d67e1b23f6bfa06a8e5b3fb" class="muted title-full-link">Fix assignees parsing in Edit Issue (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/109" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#109</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/8b06d7154e59e8056d67e1b23f6bfa06a8e5b3fb" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
