				<tr>
					<td class="author">
						<span class="avatar-stack-names"><span class="avatar-stack"><a href="mailto:johan@noreply.gitea.com"><img loading="lazy" alt class="ui avatar tw-align-middle" src="/assets/img/avatar_default.png" title="johan" width="20" height="20"></a></span><a class="muted" href="mailto:johan@noreply.gitea.com">johan</a></span>
					</td>
					<td class="sha">
						
						
							
						
						<a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/98f908d5a16b2bc6e79e927a16686acf8c1b24c3" class="ui label commit-id-short " rel="nofollow">98f908d5a1</a>
					</td>
					<td class="message">
						<span class="message-wrapper">
						
							
							<span class="commit-summary " title="Resolve ERROR - Invalid configuration: Server &#39;gitea&#39; &#39;args&#39; must be a list (#101)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/98f908d5a16b2bc6e79e927a16686acf8c1b24c3" class="muted title-full-link">Resolve ERROR - Invalid configuration: Server &#39;gitea&#39; &#39;args&#39; must be a list (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/101" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#101</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/98f908d5a16b2bc6e79e927a16686acf8c1b24c3" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
							</span>
						
						</span>
						
						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">If you assume the template is correctly formatted, you will get this error during startup:

Starting MCP OpenAPI Proxy with config file: /app/config.json
2025-10-17 19:03:07,288 - INFO -   CORS Allowed Origins: [&#39;*&#39;]
2025-10-17 19:03:07,288 - INFO -   Path Prefix: /
2025-10-17 19:03:07,289 - INFO -   Root Path:
2025-10-17 19:03:07,289 - INFO - Loading MCP server configurations from: /app/config.json
2025-10-17 19:03:07,289 - ERROR - Invalid configuration: Server &#39;gitea&#39; &#39;args&#39; must be a list

Reviewed-on: <a href="https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/101" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/101</a>
Reviewed-by: Lunny Xiao &lt;<a href="mailto:xiaolunwen@gmail.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">xiaolunwen@gmail.com</a>&gt;
Co-authored-by: johan &lt;<a href="mailto:johan@noreply.gitea.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">johan@noreply.gitea.com</a>&gt;
Co-committed-by: johan &lt;<a href="mailto:johan@noreply.gitea.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">johan@noreply.gitea.com</a>&gt;</pre>
						
						
					</td>
