						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">- Update dependencies to newer versions for multiple modules
- Upgrade code.gitea.io/sdk/gitea to v0.22.0
- Upgrade github.com/mark3labs/mcp-go to v0.40.0
- Update indirect dependencies: github.com/mailru/easyjson, github.com/spf13/cast, golang.org/x/crypto, and golang.org/x/sys

Signed-off-by: appleboy &lt;<a href="mailto:appleboy.tw@gmail.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">appleboy.tw@gmail.com</a>&gt;</pre>
						
						
