					<td class="message">
						<span class="message-wrapper">
						
							
							<span class="commit-summary " title="feat: added parameter &#39;organization&#39; to tool &#39;create_repo&#39; (#88)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/f33b04a3df742376b1277768617c7dfc5b299a03" class="muted title-full-link">feat: added parameter &#39;organization&#39; to tool &#39;create_repo&#39; (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/88" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#88</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/f33b04a3df742376b1277768617c7dfc5b299a03" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
							</span>
						
						</span>
						
						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">Using the Gitea-mcp server I was missing the ability to create repositories in other organizations. e.g.:
* I was only able to create `<a href="https://gitea.domain.com/myuser/repo" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.domain.com/myuser/repo</a>` <span class="emoji" data-alias="white_check_mark">✅</span>
* I was not able to create `<a href="https://gitea.domain.com/organization/repo" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.domain.com/organization/repo</a>` <span class="emoji" data-alias="x">❌</span>

This feature was planned, implemented and compiled by Claude Code. I have no clue about Golang.

I then took the resulting `gitea-mcp` file and sucessfully tested it on my self-hosted gitea instance:
* Creating `<a href="https://gitea.domain.com/myuser/repo" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.domain.com/myuser/repo</a>` <span class="emoji" data-alias="white_check_mark">✅</span>
* Creating `<a href="https://gitea.domain.com/organization/repo" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.domain.com/organization/repo</a>` <span class="emoji" data-alias="white_check_mark">✅</span>

Reviewed-on: <a href="https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/88" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/88</a>
