						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">- Import the fmt package to enable string formatting
- Set a custom user agent for the Gitea client using the current server version

Signed-off-by: appleboy &lt;<a href="mailto:appleboy.tw@gmail.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">appleboy.tw@gmail.com</a>&gt;

