<a href="https://gitea.com/fitithw/gitea-mcp/src/commit/11e04b5b8de5dc8a60c1d0a10dd9979e0d31998f/operation/repo/release.go#L67-L68" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/fitithw/gitea-mcp/src/commit/11e04b5b8de5dc8a60c1d0a10dd9979e0d31998f/operation/repo/release.go#L67-L68</a>

