					<td class="message">
						<span class="message-wrapper">
						
							
							<span class="commit-summary " title="feat: add HTTP server mode with updated docs and localization (#45)">
								<span class="title-full-link-hover"><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/f25cc0de8cd3435d5c4fe2182147f2ddd8a122a7" class="muted title-full-link">feat: add HTTP server mode with updated docs and localization (</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/issues/45" data-markdown-generated-content="" class="ref-issue">#45</a><a href="/gronod/gitea-mcp/commit/f25cc0de8cd3435d5c4fe2182147f2ddd8a122a7" class="muted title-full-link">)</a></span>
							</span>
						
						</span>
						
						<button type="button" class="ui button ellipsis-button" aria-expanded="false" data-global-click="onRepoEllipsisButtonClick">...</button>
						
						

						
						<pre class="commit-body tw-hidden">- Update download instructions for clarity and consistency in all README files
- Add example configuration for HTTP mode to all README files
- Expand transport type support to include &#34;http&#34; in command-line flags and documentation
- Implement HTTP server mode in the application entrypoint
- Update log output behavior to include &#34;http&#34; mode alongside &#34;sse&#34; for stdout logging
- Refine Chinese README translations for greater accuracy and localization

Signed-off-by: appleboy &lt;<a href="mailto:appleboy.tw@gmail.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">appleboy.tw@gmail.com</a>&gt;

Reviewed-on: <a href="https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/45" data-markdown-generated-content="">https://gitea.com/gitea/gitea-mcp/pulls/45</a>
Co-authored-by: appleboy &lt;<a href="mailto:appleboy.tw@gmail.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">appleboy.tw@gmail.com</a>&gt;
Co-committed-by: appleboy &lt;<a href="mailto:appleboy.tw@gmail.com" data-markdown-generated-content="">appleboy.tw@gmail.com</a>&gt;</pre>
						
						
