				<td class="chroma lines-code"><code class="code-inner"><span class="k">-</span> Use Conventional Commits for commit messages and PR titles, e.g. <span class="sb">`type(scope): subject`</span>; <span class="sb">`!`</span> before the colon if breaking. Use <span class="sb">`test`</span> type for test-only changes.
