				<td class="chroma lines-code"><code class="code-inner"><span class="k">-</span> Add an <span class="sb">`Assisted-by: AGENT_NAME:MODEL_VERSION`</span> trailer to commit messages, never <span class="sb">`Co-Authored-By`</span> or <span class="sb">`Signed-off-by`</span>
