			<td class="lines-type-marker"><span class="tw-font-mono" data-type-marker="-"></span></td>
			
				<td class="chroma lines-code lines-code-old"><code class="code-inner"><span class="gs">**Gitea MCP Server</span><span class="gs">**</span> <span class="removed-code">is an integration plugin designed to connect Gitea with M</span>odel<span class="removed-code"> C</span>ontext<span class="removed-code"> P</span>rotocol<span class="removed-code"> (MCP) systems. This allows for seaml</span>ess <span class="removed-code">command execution and repository management through</span> an MCP-compatible chat interface.
</code>
</td>
			
		</tr>
		
	
		<tr class="add-code nl-5 ol-5" data-line-type="add">
			
