			</td>
			<td class="lines-type-marker"><span class="tw-font-mono" data-type-marker="&#43;"></span></td>
			
				<td class="chroma lines-code"><code class="code-inner"><span class="gs">**Gitea MCP Server</span><span class="gs">**</span> <span class="added-code">connects a [<span class="nt">Gitea</span>](</span><span class="na"><span class="added-code">https://about.gitea.com</span></span><span class="added-code">) instance to [</span><span class="nt"><span class="added-code">Model Context Protocol</span></span><span class="added-code">](</span><span class="na"><span class="added-code">https://m</span>odel<span class="added-code">c</span>ontext<span class="added-code">p</span>rotocol<span class="added-code">.io</span></span><span class="added-code">) clients, so repositories, issues, pull requ</span>es<span class="added-code">t</span>s <span class="added-code">and more can be browsed and managed from</span> an MCP-compatible chat interface.
</code>
</td>
			
		</tr>
		
	
