			<td class="lines-type-marker"><span class="tw-font-mono" data-type-marker="-"></span></td>
			
				<td class="chroma lines-code lines-code-old"><code class="code-inner">Gitea is a community-managed lightweight code hosting solution written in Go. It is published under the MIT license. Gitea provides Git hosting including a repository viewer, issue tracking, pull requests, and more.
</code>
</td>
			
		</tr>
		
	
		<tr class="add-code nl-14 ol-14" data-line-type="add">
			
