			<td class="lines-type-marker"><span class="tw-font-mono" data-type-marker="-"></span></td>
			
				<td class="chroma lines-code lines-code-old"><code class="code-inner">Model Context Protocol (MCP) is a protocol that allows for the integration of various tools and systems through a chat interface. It enables seamless command execution and management of repositories, users, and other resources.
</code>
</td>
			
		</tr>
		
	
