			</td>
			<td class="lines-type-marker"><span class="tw-font-mono" data-type-marker="&#43;"></span></td>
			
				<td class="chroma lines-code"><code class="code-inner">Pass the Gitea host and access token as command-line flags or environment variables, flags take precedence. Run <span class="sb">`gitea-mcp --help`</span> for the full list of flags and environment variables. Logs are written to <span class="sb">`$HOME/.gitea-mcp/gitea-mcp.log`</span>, add <span class="sb">`-d`</span> for debug logging.
</code>
</td>
			
		</tr>
		
	
